      "id": "claim_d6b36ea22a874b0da71cc1092bae454e",
      "statement": "Normal dcode startup captures a workspace and resolved ServerConfig, scaffolds and starts a loopback LangGraph server on an ephemeral-port default, waits for the agent graph, configures the RemoteAgent workspace policy, and stops the owned server in a finally block if handoff does not complete, including cancellation.",
